<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,713.72 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,713.72 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at a fifth successive closing high of 7,713.72 points on Tuesday, up 82.30, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover rose to 7.651 billion forints from Monday's 7.034 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
